        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Greedy/mission_raccoon/scene_raccoon_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f03a4c5a-767f-4315-a160-baef4bd1def0).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rWe find ourselves in the middle of a double-cross. Two pairs of infamous robbers, known respectively as &quot;The Tech Mob&quot; and &quot;Penny Dreadful&quot; have teamed up to steal a Milton Fitzpatrick armored truck. Each has contracted us to eliminate the other so they can keep the profits for themselves.\r\rThey have also requested that each target be eliminated using a different type of accident.\r\rFinally, with all the robbers removed, we may as well take the truck ourselves.\r\rGood luck.",
        "GameVersion": "8.23.0.0",
